// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P49806760" "{HeroName}, you've arrived just in time! Ah, that temporal portal you destroyed was just the tip of the iceberg. There must have been more of them, somewhere, because a huge army of 5th Column troops has invaded Boomtown! Erm, please, would you and your friends go there to see what you can do to help fight them off?"
// AcceptString :
"P3647900209" "Stop the 5th Column"
// SendOffString :
"P1224713306" "Erm, I can't help but think that this is all somehow related to the information those villains took from Hero 1's time capsule. Keep your eyes open for anything unusual while you're there... well, more unusual than a 5th Column invasion, that is! <br><br>If you run into more trouble than you can handle, don't be a hero! <color orange>Erm, I mean, don't be shy about withdrawing to approach the problem from another angle.</color> The important thing is to stop the invasion, and if you can shut down their portals, you'll slow the 5th Column down enough to let Paragon City rally its forces.<br><br>Erm, be careful out there! This is a dangerous situation."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P830800127" "Defeat the 5th Column Invasion"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2524579012" "You still need to kick the 5th Column out of Boomtown."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3151873508" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: A Boom Time in the Old Town</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P2293160647" "Boomtown"
// EntryString :
"P3084805022" "There sure are a lot of invaders here."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3333355445" "Generalmajor Strucker"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3386579296" "Generalmajor Strucker is a true 5th Column loyalist. He's remained hidden between Time with the bulk of the 5th Column forces, waiting for the time when the glorious day would come and the 5th Column would emerge once again, in all of its glory."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2885227059" "At last! The day of our triumph is upon us!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1864120501" "Your efforts are doomed to failure, heroes."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1706576909" "Generalmajor Shultz"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2097504513" "Generalmajor Shultz rose to the top of the ranks of the 5th Column by making certain he saw nothing and heard nothing that would get him in trouble. A master of avoiding blame, Shultz is still a competent general."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1980224602" "You there! Get to work. We don't want to get caught loitering."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2344632017" "No! Do not let {HeroName} interfere with the plan!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2954250914" "Generalmajor Sinclair"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2209141643" "Generalmajor Sinclair spent years undercover in Paragon City, waiting for the 5th Column to rise again and make its move. He's estatic to be one of the primary leaders of the Column's boldest move yet."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1744186050" "I've waited a long time for this day to come, and I must tell you it feels good to be here."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3454679824" "You won't interfere with me, {HeroName}. Not today, of all days!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2769624395" "Generalmajor von Kleig"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2824608046" "One of the brightest lights in the 5th Column military, von Kleig is a skilled general who lets nothing stand in his way."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2466488018" "Ja, you will proceed with the invasion plan now."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2076479650" "Actung! Stop the intruders!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P884969317" "Generalmajor Leitter"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2278282518" "Generalmajor Leitter commands the elite 5th Armee of the 5th Column. His presence in the invasion force is a sign on just how much the 5th Column has committed to this effort."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2843999608" "Assemble in the standard formation and conduct a sweep to the west."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2854499175" "Ach, we have planned for this! Troops, mass fire on the heroes!"
// Script Variable OBJECT_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2993850061" "Troop Invasion Portal"

