// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2145875341" "Invincible Reichsman"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1083230766" "Ah, {HeroName}, you cannot imagine how good this feels.<t=3>You were not able to stop those dupes from getting what was needed to free me, and now I find myself at the head of a new army, ready to crush all opposition. Though you were not the cause of my long incarceration, you will be among those who pay for that indignity!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3703922209" "You can pit your puny powers against me, but it will do you no good.<t=4>I was better than anyone before, and now I've been enhanced... supercharged.<t=4>Do what you will; you can't touch me. No one can. I'm unstoppable!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2971204492" "Your failure is inevitable, {HeroName}. You cannot even hurt me while I... I can certainly hurt you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Timer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1655548380" "Defeat Reichsman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
