"P858364742" "Ritter Franz is one of the 5th Column's top security experts, which is likely why he's been put in charge of securing this base."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P622669540" "Keep your eyes open. We do not want any slip ups now."
