"P2565272300" "This computer has nothing of interest on it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2670543841" "This computer stored a file with information on some powerful arch villains. It looks like Reichsman is trying to make contact with them, but for what?."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Information 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3548119476" "Find the information"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3256817931" "This computer has files on a number of people named Marcus Cole, all of whom seem to be from alternate dimensions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2418962717" "Dr. Kahn should be able to figure out if there's anything useful in the computer files."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P134217460" "Ah, you have some information for me, {HeroName}. Thank you! Let me read these and, erm, see where they lead us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2512745812" "I've been reading over those files you recovered, {HeroName}, and it looks like you have quite a problem on your hands."
// Answer Text :
"P250138041" "Ask why Reichsman is so powerful."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3256667818" "I believe that Reichsman has kidnapped a number of his counterparts and is somehow transfering a portion of their power to himself. This is making him incredibly powerful, as you've seen.<br><br>Right now, I don't believe that there's a hero -- or hero team -- that can stand up to him. If he continues unchecked, his invasion will succeed and Paragon City will be conquered by him and his new allies in the revived the 5th Column."
// Answer Text :
"P1834942469" "Ask how you can defeat Reichsman."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3369021742" "Reichsman is enhancing himself with cross-dimensional energy. If you can somehow reinforce his connection to his home dimension, you should be able to 'ground' him and; in effect, short out much of his added power. Reichsman will still be very powerful, but I believe you and your companions will be able to defeat him.<br><br>We know the coordinates of Reichsman's home dimension. If you go through the portal and and tap some energy sources, I should be able to use that energy to power a modified Malta Group Sapper Rifle. If you hit Reichsman with a shot from the rifle, it should create a stronger connection between him and his home dimension, which will weaken him. Here, this scanner will let you see the sources. When you find them, just plant one of these taps on each one. I'll need about five sources to power the 'grounding ray'.<br><br>Good luck, {HeroName}!"
// Answer Text :
"P2141117208" "Leave."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P747933676" "The files were all information on different versions of Marcus Coles from alternate Earths. Erm, I'm not sure what that's leading to myself, but if it involves alternate realities, then <color orange>Tina MacIntyre should be able to figure out what's going on.</color> You should go speak with her."
// AcceptString :
"P1905740396" "Go talk with Tina MacIntyre"
// SendOffString :
"P1522749319" "Ah, I've already forward the files to Tina, so she'll be up to speed when you speak with her. If anyone can figure out this dimensional stuff, it will be her."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4038830572" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: Visiting the Old Country</color>"

