// IntroString :
"P1658564630" "The time has come for your team to make their final stand against Reichsman and his forces. He's back in his base under Boomtown, up to something big, according to our informants. The concept of something bigger than an all-out invasion frightens me, {HeroName}. <color orange>You need to get to Reichsman's base and stop him before it is too late.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3618115998" "Go face Reichsman in his base."
// SendOffString :
"P1916241135" "Tina MacIntyre's dimensional grounding device should give you the edge you'll need in your upcoming fight.<br><br>Good luck to you all, {HeroName}. We're counting on you!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3664170435" "You need to go to the 5th Column base under Boomtown and defeat Reichsman."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1598235553" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: A Meeting of Minds</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P63003552" "Reichsman's Base"
// EntryString :
"P2234252760" "This base seems far too calm and organized to you. You'd expect more action from a group that's conducting an invasion. Something else must be going on..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2668258976" "Reichsman"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1139829828" "Already no one can stand before me. I bring you here to demonstrate my power and to let you know that I am now the one in charge.<em>So I tell you this: I am supreme. Acknowledge that and you will continue to enjoy your freedom. Dispute that, and you will be crushed, like I am crushing the pitiful resistance in this Boomtown."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P265956360" "Once again, you heroes seek to thwart me. And once again, I shall send you running back to your mothers like little children scared of the dark!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P3141440132" "Your attacks feel as light as love taps, {HeroName}. Try again."
// Script Variable BOSS_1ST_DIALOG :
"P1532106129" "What have you done to me? Countess, you will assist me with these heroes! It is your only option if you wish to remain free."
// Script Variable BOSS_2ND_DIALOG :
"P2028589432" "I cannot fail! You will not stop me! Nemesis, to me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_3RD_DIALOG :
"P2145878213" "Vas? What is happening? How did you get so powerful?<em>Gyrfalcon, come aid me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_4TH_DIALOG :
"P2907409450" "Your talents can aid my cause, Vanessa Devore<em>To me!"
// Script Variable TETHER_DIALOG :
"P606853106" "You cannot lure me away from the power of my machine!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ReichsmanSpanked 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1402264406" "Stop Reichsman!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3405136234" "You've defeated Reichsman and ended his threat to Paragon City."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2601722639" "Herr Krogh"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P120476218" "Herr Krogh has remained loyal to the 5th Column cause and has been waiting for the day when he could emerge from the shadows and strike back at all those who oppose his organization."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3394918296" "Loyal soldiers of the 5th Column! Now is the time for action!<em>Even now our new leader, Reichsman, sets in motion the final piece of his plan that will bring the Glorious Day of our triumph!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2482511166" "It's {HeroName} and {Hero.gender=male his|her} allies! Stop them from reaching Reichsman!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4156646039" "Countess Crey"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2685445571" "I was lured here thinking you had a business proposition for me, Reichsman. I'm not interested in any merger with your cause, especially with you in the top slot. You're wasting your time!."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3606889415" "Ugh, I knew coming here was a bad idea. I'm done with you Reichsman, but I'm not about to let this bad press get out!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CountDown 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2781969827" "Nemesis"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P244159466" "I need not fear you, Reichsman. You bluster and threaten, but in the end you cannot harm me. My plans remain unparalleled."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2766707920" "Fool! Do you think I am truly the real version? Nevertheless, I shall indulge your request, simply to show you that even with MY help your plan will not succeed! "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - NemDown 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1215206417" "Gyrfalcon"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P565941025" "Why would you think the Malta Group would throw its resources in with your bunch of fascists, Herr Reichsman? It is a good thing I'm restrained by this bubble, or I'd show you exactly what we do with your type."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2777023647" "Hero intervention! You can't control your own base. I'll do what I have to to save my own skin, but don't come near me after this, Reichsman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - GyrDown 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P714351739" "Vanessa Devore"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P155364213" "You amuse me, Reichsman. You in charge of everything? Ha."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P255735417" "<color red>Your</color> cause? Hah! Don't make me laugh darling, I work for <color red>myself</color>. But I'm not just about to pass up this chance to add some more souls to my collection! "

